    "英数字と . _ - が使えます（記号は連続不可、先頭と末尾は英数字）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use letters, digits, . _ and - (no consecutive symbols; start and end with a letter or digit)."
